                        "review": "After having this game on my WL for over 5 years, I finally decided to give in. Even though I had heavy doubts due to the reviews, I grabbed my purse and took the enormeous amount of 1,46€ to buy a key for this game. And I feel ripped off. \n\nThe movement in this game isn't even half bad, to be honest. And many of the game's aspects are actually reminiscent of the good old FPS games era. \n\nBut what's really irritating is the graphics. They are ALL over the place and look somewhat like you made your toddler's coloring book into a game. \n\nFeels weird, isn't any fun at all and I did not get accustomed to it at all. Cannot recommend.",
